flowchart TD
    Input[Extracted PDF text] --> Messages[System instructions + HumanMessage]
    Messages --> LLM[ChatGroq JSON response mode]
    LLM --> Content[response.content]
    Content --> Parse[JSON.parse]
    Parse --> Normalize[Map strength/strengths and weakness/weaknesses aliases]
    Normalize --> Output[Return analysis object]
    Parse -->|Error| ControllerCatch[Resume controller handles failure]
    LLM -->|Error| ControllerCatch
    Output --> Mongo[Controller persists MongoDB]
    Mongo --> Redis[Controller caches Redis]
